# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# HackReel-specific
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Generated output. Every run writes a new timestamped bundle: slides, mp3s,
# mp4s. Not source, and it grows without bound.
#
# It also contains publish_receipt.json, which holds the LIVE Zernio response -
# platform post ids, the TikTok account id, CDN media urls and the account
# display name. Those must not reach a public repo.
assets/output/
assets/temp/

# Credentials are read from the environment ONLY and are never written to a
# file by this project. These are backstops in case someone adds a dotenv.
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example

# ntfy approval topic names. ntfy.sh topics are unauthenticated: anyone who can
# read the topic name can send an approval, so treat these as secrets.
mltok-ntfy.conf
*ntfy*.conf

